<template>
  <section>
    <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">Max Files</h2>
    <p class="pdx-txt-small pdx-ink-muted">
      Limit to 3 files maximum. Files over the limit are listed under the zone as refused, each
      with a <code>pdx-error</code>. Removing a file moves focus to the next file's remove button.
    </p>

